---
pagination:
  addAllPagesToCollections: true
  data: site.langs
  size: 1
  alias: lang
permalink: "{{ '/en/team.html' if lang == 'en' else '/team.html' }}"
layout: base.njk
nav: "team"
navSolid: true
noindex: true   # MOCKUP-PHASE: Beispielfotos/-texte → nicht indexieren. Vor Go-Live entfernen.
langDE: "/team.html"
langEN: "/en/team.html"

titleDE: "Team — LIBA Lingener Baumaschinen"
titleEN: "Our Team — LIBA Lingener Baumaschinen"
descDE: "Das Team hinter LIBA – Lingener Baumaschinen: Geschäftsführung, Konstrukteure, Schweißer und Monteure, die seit Jahrzehnten Grabenfräsen für den weltweiten Einsatz bauen."
descEN: "The team behind LIBA – Lingener Baumaschinen: management, engineers, welders and assembly technicians who have been building trench cutters for worldwide deployment for decades."
canonicalDE: "https://lingener-baumaschinen.de/team.html"
canonicalEN: "https://lingener-baumaschinen.de/en/team.html"
ogTitleDE: "Über uns — LIBA Lingener Baumaschinen"
ogTitleEN: "About Us — LIBA Lingener Baumaschinen"
ogDescDE: "Menschen, die LIBA ausmachen: Geschäftsführung, Konstruktion, Fertigung — alle unter einem Dach in Lingen (Ems)."
ogDescEN: "The people who make LIBA: management, engineering, manufacturing — all under one roof in Lingen (Ems)."

eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ titleDE if lang == 'de' else titleEN }}"
  description: "{{ descDE if lang == 'de' else descEN }}"
  canonical: "{{ canonicalDE if lang == 'de' else canonicalEN }}"
  ogTitle: "{{ ogTitleDE if lang == 'de' else ogTitleEN }}"
  ogDescription: "{{ ogDescDE if lang == 'de' else ogDescEN }}"
  ogLocale: "{{ 'de_DE' if lang == 'de' else 'en_GB' }}"
---

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-bg" style="background-image: url('/assets/images/hero/hero-3.jpg');" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="breadcrumbs">
      <a href="{% if lang == 'de' %}/index.html{% else %}/en/index.html{% endif %}">{% if lang == "de" %}Start{% else %}Home{% endif %}</a>
      <span class="sep">/</span>
      <span>{% if lang == "de" %}Über uns{% else %}About Us{% endif %}</span>
    </div>
    <span class="eyebrow hero-eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>{% if lang == "de" %}Das Team{% else %}The Team{% endif %}</span>
    <h1 data-split-lines class="mt-3">{% if lang == "de" %}Das Team hinter LIBA.<br><em class="serif-italic">Menschen, die Maschinen bauen.</em>{% else %}The team behind LIBA.<br><em class="serif-italic">People who build machines.</em>{% endif %}</h1>
    <p>{% if lang == "de" %}Nicht Konzern, nicht anonym — ein Team aus Lingen (Ems), das seit Jahrzehnten Grabenfräsen baut, die auf der ganzen Welt im Einsatz sind.{% else %}Not a corporation, not anonymous — a team from Lingen (Ems) that has been building trench cutters for decades, deployed all over the world.{% endif %}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 01 / Geschäftsführer -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split align-start reveal">
      <div>
        <span class="section-index">{% if lang == "de" %}01 / Geschäftsführer{% else %}01 / Managing Director{% endif %}</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3">{% if lang == "de" %}Inhabergeführt.<br><em class="serif-italic">In der dritten Generation.</em>{% else %}Owner-managed.<br><em class="serif-italic">Third generation.</em>{% endif %}</h2>
        <p class="lead mt-3">{% if lang == "de" %}Markus Berg (Beispiel) führt LIBA in dritter Generation. Nach dem Maschinenbaustudium und mehreren Jahren im internationalen Anlagenbau übernahm er 2018 die Geschäftsführung des Familienunternehmens.{% else %}Markus Berg (example) leads LIBA in the third generation. After studying mechanical engineering and several years in international plant construction, he took over as managing director of the family business in 2018.{% endif %}</p>
        <p class="mt-3" style="color: var(--steel-700);">{% if lang == "de" %}Aufgewachsen ist er praktisch in der Werkhalle — schon als Jugendlicher half er in der Montage mit. Heute treibt ihn vor allem eines an: Grabenfräsen zu bauen, die auch unter härtesten Bedingungen zuverlässig laufen. <em>(Beispieltext)</em>{% else %}He practically grew up on the shop floor — as a teenager he was already lending a hand in assembly. Today, one thing drives him above all: building trench cutters that run reliably even under the toughest conditions. <em>(example text)</em>{% endif %}</p>
        <ul class="team-facts mt-4">
          <li>
            <span class="team-facts-key">{% if lang == "de" %}Funktion{% else %}Role{% endif %}</span>
            <span class="team-facts-val">{% if lang == "de" %}Geschäftsführer{% else %}Managing Director{% endif %}</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="team-facts-key">{% if lang == "de" %}Im Amt seit{% else %}In role since{% endif %}</span>
            <span class="team-facts-val">2018 <em style="color:var(--steel-600);font-style:italic;">(Beispiel)</em></span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="team-facts-key">{% if lang == "de" %}Generation{% else %}Generation{% endif %}</span>
            <span class="team-facts-val">{% if lang == "de" %}3. Generation der Gründerfamilie{% else %}3rd generation of founding family{% endif %}</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="team-facts-key">{% if lang == "de" %}Standort{% else %}Location{% endif %}</span>
            <span class="team-facts-val">Lingen (Ems)</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="media-frame">
        <span class="mockup-badge">{% if lang == "de" %}Beispielbild · Mockup{% else %}Example · Mockup{% endif %}</span>
        <picture>
          <source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/images/team/gf-mockup.webp">
          <img src="/assets/images/team/gf-mockup.jpg" alt="{% if lang == 'de' %}Beispielfoto des Geschäftsführers von LIBA{% else %}Example photo of the LIBA managing director{% endif %}" width="1024" height="1365" loading="lazy">
        </picture>
        <span class="tag">Markus Berg{% if lang == "de" %} (Beispiel) · Geschäftsführer{% else %} (example) · Managing Director{% endif %}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 02 / Das Team -->
<section class="section section-dark">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <div class="heading">
        <span class="section-index is-dark" style="color: var(--brand-light);">{% if lang == "de" %}02 / Das Team{% else %}02 / The Team{% endif %}</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3">{% if lang == "de" %}Die Menschen<br><em class="serif-italic">hinter den Maschinen.</em>{% else %}The people<br><em class="serif-italic">behind the machines.</em>{% endif %}</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="aside">
        <p class="lead">{% if lang == "de" %}Ein eingespieltes Team aus Konstrukteuren, Schweißern, Monteuren und Servicefachleuten — alle unter einem Dach in Lingen (Ems).{% else %}A close-knit team of engineers, welders, assembly technicians and service specialists — all under one roof in Lingen (Ems).{% endif %}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="team-grid reveal">
      <div class="team-card">
        <div class="team-card-photo">
          <span class="mockup-badge">{% if lang == "de" %}Beispiel{% else %}Example{% endif %}</span>
          <picture>
            <source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/images/team/team-konstruktion.webp">
            <img src="/assets/images/team/team-konstruktion.jpg" alt="{% if lang == 'de' %}Beispielfoto Mitarbeiterin Konstruktion bei LIBA{% else %}Example photo of a LIBA engineering team member{% endif %}" width="600" height="800" loading="lazy">
          </picture>
        </div>
        <div class="team-card-body">
          <div class="team-card-name">Lena Brinkmann</div>
          <div class="team-card-role">{% if lang == "de" %}Konstruktion{% else %}Engineering{% endif %}</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="team-card">
        <div class="team-card-photo">
          <span class="mockup-badge">{% if lang == "de" %}Beispiel{% else %}Example{% endif %}</span>
          <picture>
            <source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/images/team/team-fertigung.webp">
            <img src="/assets/images/team/team-fertigung.jpg" alt="{% if lang == 'de' %}Beispielfoto Mitarbeiter Fertigung bei LIBA{% else %}Example photo of a LIBA manufacturing team member{% endif %}" width="600" height="800" loading="lazy">
          </picture>
        </div>
        <div class="team-card-body">
          <div class="team-card-name">Michael Wessels</div>
          <div class="team-card-role">{% if lang == "de" %}Fertigung{% else %}Manufacturing{% endif %}</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="team-card">
        <div class="team-card-photo">
          <span class="mockup-badge">{% if lang == "de" %}Beispiel{% else %}Example{% endif %}</span>
          <picture>
            <source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/images/team/team-montage.webp">
            <img src="/assets/images/team/team-montage.jpg" alt="{% if lang == 'de' %}Beispielfoto Mitarbeiter Montage bei LIBA{% else %}Example photo of a LIBA assembly team member{% endif %}" width="600" height="800" loading="lazy">
          </picture>
        </div>
        <div class="team-card-body">
          <div class="team-card-name">Tobias Holthaus</div>
          <div class="team-card-role">{% if lang == "de" %}Montage{% else %}Assembly{% endif %}</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="team-card">
        <div class="team-card-photo">
          <span class="mockup-badge">{% if lang == "de" %}Beispiel{% else %}Example{% endif %}</span>
          <picture>
            <source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/images/team/team-vertrieb.webp">
            <img src="/assets/images/team/team-vertrieb.jpg" alt="{% if lang == 'de' %}Beispielfoto Mitarbeiterin Vertrieb & Service bei LIBA{% else %}Example photo of a LIBA sales & service team member{% endif %}" width="600" height="800" loading="lazy">
          </picture>
        </div>
        <div class="team-card-body">
          <div class="team-card-name">Sandra Pohl</div>
          <div class="team-card-role">{% if lang == "de" %}Vertrieb & Service{% else %}Sales & Service{% endif %}</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="team-card">
        <div class="team-card-photo">
          <span class="mockup-badge">{% if lang == "de" %}Beispiel{% else %}Example{% endif %}</span>
          <picture>
            <source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/images/team/team-schweisstechnik.webp">
            <img src="/assets/images/team/team-schweisstechnik.jpg" alt="{% if lang == 'de' %}Beispielfoto Schweißer bei LIBA{% else %}Example photo of a LIBA welder{% endif %}" width="600" height="800" loading="lazy">
          </picture>
        </div>
        <div class="team-card-body">
          <div class="team-card-name">Heinrich Albers</div>
          <div class="team-card-role">{% if lang == "de" %}Schweißtechnik{% else %}Welding{% endif %}</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="team-card">
        <div class="team-card-photo">
          <span class="mockup-badge">{% if lang == "de" %}Beispiel{% else %}Example{% endif %}</span>
          <picture>
            <source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/images/team/team-service.webp">
            <img src="/assets/images/team/team-service.jpg" alt="{% if lang == 'de' %}Beispielfoto Mitarbeiter Ersatzteile & Service bei LIBA{% else %}Example photo of a LIBA spare parts & service team member{% endif %}" width="600" height="800" loading="lazy">
          </picture>
        </div>
        <div class="team-card-body">
          <div class="team-card-name">Jonas Frye</div>
          <div class="team-card-role">{% if lang == "de" %}Ersatzteile & Service{% else %}Spare Parts & Service{% endif %}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 03 / Motivation -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split align-start reveal">
      <div class="media-frame">
        <span class="mockup-badge">{% if lang == "de" %}Beispielbild · Mockup{% else %}Example · Mockup{% endif %}</span>
        <picture>
          <source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/images/team/gf-mockup.webp">
          <img src="/assets/images/team/gf-mockup.jpg" alt="{% if lang == 'de' %}Beispielfoto des Geschäftsführers von LIBA{% else %}Example photo of the LIBA managing director{% endif %}" width="1024" height="1365" loading="lazy">
        </picture>
        <span class="tag">Markus Berg{% if lang == "de" %} (Beispiel) · Geschäftsführer{% else %} (example) · Managing Director{% endif %}</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="section-index">{% if lang == "de" %}03 / Motivation{% else %}03 / Motivation{% endif %}</span>
        <blockquote class="team-quote mt-3">
          {% if lang == "de" %}„Eine Maschine ist nur so gut wie die Menschen, die sie bauen. Wir geben unseren Namen darauf — und stehen für jede Naht gerade." <em>(Beispielzitat)</em>{% else %}"A machine is only as good as the people who build it. We put our name on it — and stand behind every weld." <em>(example quote)</em>{% endif %}
        </blockquote>
        <p class="lead mt-4" style="color: var(--steel-700);">{% if lang == "de" %}Qualität, Verlässlichkeit und kurze Wege: Was uns als Familienbetrieb im Emsland ausmacht, steckt in jeder Maschine, die unser Werk verlässt. <em>(Beispieltext)</em>{% else %}Quality, reliability and short distances: what defines us as a family business in the Emsland is built into every machine that leaves our factory. <em>(example text)</em>{% endif %}</p>
        <div class="mt-5">
          <a href="{% if lang == 'de' %}/kontakt.html{% else %}/en/kontakt.html{% endif %}" class="btn btn-primary">
            {% if lang == "de" %}Jetzt Termin vereinbaren{% else %}Book a consultation{% endif %}
            <svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
